WEBVTT

00:04.480 --> 00:07.839
I worked hard making
the fried eggs today!

00:07.840 --> 00:11.489
Don't look at the TV!
Look at me and praise my food!

00:11.490 --> 00:12.909
Yeah, yeah.
You're the best.

00:12.910 --> 00:14.899
I can't feel the sincerity in that!

00:14.900 --> 00:18.099
Sincerity? So what,
I have to bow down before you?

00:18.100 --> 00:19.450
That's it!

00:21.420 --> 00:23.189
This again?

00:23.190 --> 00:25.630
It was just peaceful the other day...

00:29.350 --> 00:33.170
Come to think of it...
She was craving the ring...

00:34.010 --> 00:35.369
#7 RING

00:35.370 --> 00:37.889
#7 RING
Can I come to your house today?

00:37.890 --> 00:39.019
Running away from home?

00:39.020 --> 00:41.979
No way.
I'm just hanging out.

00:41.980 --> 00:42.900
Is that okay?

00:43.430 --> 00:46.950
Of course.
My house is your house.

00:47.470 --> 00:50.350
All right, no taking the scenic route, then.

00:50.750 --> 00:52.430
I'll call in an express transport.

00:57.460 --> 01:00.790
Good afternoon,
Lady Shisei, Master Saito.

01:01.230 --> 01:03.790
Drive safely now, Rui.

01:04.370 --> 01:06.170
I'll send us flying, then.

01:08.130 --> 01:10.379
I told you to drive safely!

01:10.380 --> 01:12.779
On the contrary, it is safer this way.

01:12.780 --> 01:14.250
On the contrary?!

01:28.430 --> 01:30.029
Why change here?

01:30.030 --> 01:34.779
We've known each other for so long,
so no need to be embarrassed.

01:34.780 --> 01:37.039
I'm not really...

01:37.040 --> 01:40.820
Help me!

01:43.200 --> 01:44.780
Good grief.

01:48.070 --> 01:51.300
It's been a while since you came to visit.

01:51.630 --> 01:53.289
What should we play?

01:53.290 --> 01:54.430
Whatever you want.

01:55.060 --> 01:56.289
Playing dead.

01:56.290 --> 01:58.560
Anything but that, please.

01:59.060 --> 02:01.139
Then, playing vampire.

02:01.140 --> 02:06.800
In order to become a vampire,
you must let me drink your fresh blood first.

02:08.240 --> 02:08.769
Chomp.

02:08.770 --> 02:09.529
Oww!

02:09.530 --> 02:11.209
Don't bite me!

02:11.210 --> 02:13.600
What are you two doing?

02:17.530 --> 02:19.539
Aunt! This is...

02:19.540 --> 02:22.709
You can't just flirt with
each other without inviting me!

02:22.710 --> 02:26.290
You should've told me
if you're coming!

02:26.860 --> 02:29.769
You'll be eating dinner here, right?

02:29.770 --> 02:33.169
I'll have my cooks
prepare your favourite food.

02:33.170 --> 02:35.649
No, I'll go home before that.

02:35.650 --> 02:38.550
Akane's making me dinner.

02:38.980 --> 02:41.179
You sound like you just got hitched.

02:41.180 --> 02:43.430
But I did...

02:45.740 --> 02:48.669
By the way,
I have something to consult about.

02:48.670 --> 02:51.299
Finally decided to become my son-in-law?

02:51.300 --> 02:52.190
No...

02:52.580 --> 02:55.969
Is there anything I can help you with
at your company?

02:55.970 --> 02:57.409
I want work.

02:57.410 --> 03:01.090
If you want money,
just ask your grandfather.

03:01.530 --> 03:04.609
I don't want to owe him more.

03:04.610 --> 03:06.330
I want to earn my own money.

03:06.810 --> 03:08.790
What do you need work for?

03:10.770 --> 03:12.979
I want to buy a present.

03:12.980 --> 03:14.590
I see.

03:14.940 --> 03:17.699
I am deeply hurt.

03:17.700 --> 03:22.229
You're not here to play with me,

03:22.230 --> 03:25.350
but to buy a present for a woman.

03:25.670 --> 03:29.129
No, I wanted to hang out with you first,

03:29.130 --> 03:30.729
then ask this question second.

03:30.730 --> 03:32.189
Really?

03:32.190 --> 03:33.860
Y-Yeah.

03:34.370 --> 03:36.390
But, part-time work...

03:36.850 --> 03:41.990
Saito, you should be more aware
of your status as a Hojo.

03:42.300 --> 03:45.710
You will be the one succeeding your grandfather.

03:46.160 --> 03:49.629
He even made you
marry a commoner girl.

03:49.630 --> 03:53.000
Are you against my marriage with Akane?

03:53.570 --> 03:54.960
Of course.

03:55.500 --> 03:57.510
What I was expecting is...

04:01.750 --> 04:03.110
Oh, well.

04:03.730 --> 04:07.820
Seems like our company's
localisation team is in a pinch.

04:08.270 --> 04:12.150
The language used is so rarely used,
so we couldn't find a translator.

04:12.510 --> 04:15.490
Do you think you can learn
that language in three days?

04:15.840 --> 04:19.659
Three days? Don't be stupid.

04:19.660 --> 04:22.700
Give me a night.
That should be enough.

04:25.060 --> 04:27.110
All right, it's input time.

04:30.050 --> 04:33.329
I can't believe you're studying?!
What happened?!

04:33.330 --> 04:34.340
Are you going to die?!

04:34.730 --> 04:36.989
Yeah, there's a language I want to learn.

04:36.990 --> 04:39.989
A what now?
That's how you study it?

04:39.990 --> 04:42.779
Yep. I got it all inside my head for now.

04:42.780 --> 04:46.220
Now I just need to sleep
and fix it down inside my head.

04:46.850 --> 04:49.359
I want you inside me.

04:49.360 --> 04:50.639
Wow, that's lewd.

04:50.640 --> 04:53.269
That's not what I mean!
Are you a pervert?!

04:53.270 --> 04:54.899
I'm saying I want your brain!

04:54.900 --> 04:57.419
Get it out of your head
and give it to me now!

04:57.420 --> 04:58.820
Whoa, hey!

04:59.370 --> 05:02.989
What language is this?
Are you travelling abroad?

05:02.990 --> 05:06.489
Well, don't worry about it.
It doesn't concern you.

05:06.490 --> 05:10.369
Huh? Sure, it doesn't concern me,
but that attitude of yours pisses me off!

05:10.370 --> 05:11.500
Spit it out!

05:14.550 --> 05:17.919
He's going home with Shisei again today.

05:17.920 --> 05:18.880
Yeah.

05:19.540 --> 05:22.010
Who cares about him?!

05:28.110 --> 05:30.429
Don't sit on me like
it's the natural thing to do.

05:30.430 --> 05:33.229
Your lap is mine.

05:33.230 --> 05:35.150
You're making it hard to type...

05:35.500 --> 05:35.929
Chomp.

05:35.930 --> 05:36.809
Oww!

05:36.810 --> 05:39.909
I told you, don't bite me!
I'm trying to work here!

05:39.910 --> 05:43.259
It's also part of your job to humour me.

05:43.260 --> 05:45.609
Are you sulking?

05:45.610 --> 05:48.339
Since I'm working to get
a present for Akane.

05:48.340 --> 05:52.179
No. I know you'll need that present
to win over Akane's heart,

05:52.180 --> 05:56.349
in order for you to live more comfortably.

05:56.350 --> 05:57.170
Then...

05:57.660 --> 06:02.269
But ever since you got married,
I have less time to spend with you.

06:02.270 --> 06:05.909
I can't blame you since
you're doing this for your dream,

06:05.910 --> 06:07.680
but I'm lonely.

06:09.730 --> 06:12.060
Right. Sorry.

06:12.470 --> 06:16.419
You're not at fault here.
You're doing your best, Cousin.

06:16.420 --> 06:19.469
Always spoiling me, aren't you?

06:19.470 --> 06:22.620
I want to be spoiled by you too.

06:23.100 --> 06:24.730
Spoil?

06:25.210 --> 06:26.320
Come with me.

06:27.600 --> 06:32.219
Put me to sleep gently like in the past.

06:32.220 --> 06:33.690
Fine.

06:35.040 --> 06:37.939
I love your scent...

06:37.940 --> 06:42.880
It feels so good when you're hugging me.

06:47.430 --> 06:49.449
You sure are late again today.

06:49.450 --> 06:51.720
What kind of scenic route did you take?

06:52.110 --> 06:54.299
I just had some errands to run.

06:54.300 --> 06:55.749
And what are they?

06:55.750 --> 06:57.099
It doesn't concern you.

06:57.100 --> 06:58.229
That again?

06:58.230 --> 07:02.630
Sorry, I'm tired today, so I'll take a shower
and head straight to bed.

07:03.680 --> 07:04.530
Huh?

07:05.570 --> 07:07.890
Is that a girl's scent?

07:08.990 --> 07:09.929
SWEETS CAFE

07:09.930 --> 07:10.989
SWEETS CAFE
He's been coming home late these days.

07:10.990 --> 07:12.829
He's been coming home late these days.

07:12.830 --> 07:15.750
He's also refusing to eat my dinner...

07:16.130 --> 07:18.319
Are you worried about him?

07:18.320 --> 07:20.139
I'm not!

07:20.140 --> 07:25.389
Saito is a charming man, after all.
He must be popular with the girls.

07:25.390 --> 07:28.140
Is there any girl who likes him?

07:28.480 --> 07:30.909
Of course there is...

07:30.910 --> 07:35.640
She would've told me about him,
and she had a shift yesterday too.

07:36.080 --> 07:39.020
My, my. So you did your homework?

07:39.710 --> 07:44.400
You're so bad at expressing
your genuine feelings, after all.

07:44.830 --> 07:48.809
I wasn't very honest as a young girl too.

07:48.810 --> 07:54.030
I couldn't bring myself to take
Mister Tenryu's offer for a date.

07:54.450 --> 07:58.420
That's why you can't lie to yourself.

07:58.890 --> 08:02.910
We're not like you two...

08:04.270 --> 08:06.669
Akane!

08:06.670 --> 08:10.189
Saito turned down my date again!

08:10.190 --> 08:13.810
There, there.
You're a stubborn one, huh?

08:14.550 --> 08:15.810
Excuse me.

08:17.930 --> 08:19.370
This scent...

08:21.580 --> 08:23.100
Could it be...

08:27.100 --> 08:30.329
That idiot...
He's still not home yet?

08:30.330 --> 08:32.960
Well, it's easier without him around, though!

08:33.580 --> 08:37.910
That's why you can't lie to yourself.

08:43.600 --> 08:47.370
I remember that we haven't
even exchanged numbers...

08:48.670 --> 08:49.800
CITY PAGE

08:53.260 --> 08:55.489
Hojo residence.

08:55.490 --> 08:57.930
Are you Shisei's older sister?

08:58.370 --> 09:01.689
I am her maid.
Who might you be?

09:01.690 --> 09:05.739
I'm Akane Sakuramori,
Shisei's classmate.

09:05.740 --> 09:08.440
Is Saito there?

09:08.960 --> 09:11.449
Master Saito is here.

09:11.450 --> 09:13.259
Could you get him on the phone?

09:13.260 --> 09:15.130
Please wait a moment.

09:18.050 --> 09:20.009
Hey, how long are you going to...

09:20.010 --> 09:24.239
I suppose this is our first time chatting.
I am Shisei's mother.

09:24.240 --> 09:25.089
Huh?

09:25.090 --> 09:28.109
So you're Saito's spouse?

09:28.110 --> 09:30.970
I've heard about you
from Shisei and Father.

09:31.290 --> 09:34.699
N-Nice to meet you. I'm Akane.

09:34.700 --> 09:38.850
Sorry, but Saito's kind of busy now.

09:39.310 --> 09:42.099
Could you get him on the phone
just for a minute?

09:42.100 --> 09:43.260
No.

09:44.540 --> 09:47.179
What is he doing?

09:47.180 --> 09:51.429
It doesn't concern you, yes?
He'll be home eventually.

09:51.430 --> 09:52.910
But...

09:54.010 --> 09:58.499
Hey, weren't you forced to marry him?

09:58.500 --> 09:59.620
Yes...

10:00.110 --> 10:03.540
I hear you're really on bad terms with Saito.

10:04.190 --> 10:08.020
Yet, you're being spun around
on my father's whim.

10:08.580 --> 10:11.130
I also sympathise with you.

10:12.800 --> 10:16.469
Your marriage is merely a formality.

10:16.470 --> 10:21.050
You're just a fake wife.
Why would you care about him?

10:23.920 --> 10:25.230
Fake...

10:25.810 --> 10:28.000
She's right...

10:29.740 --> 10:30.980
Good work.

10:31.360 --> 10:34.530
The staff member in charge has
reported the completion of the delivery.

10:34.940 --> 10:36.410
Here's your payment.

10:36.910 --> 10:39.869
Are you sure you don't want
to check the content?

10:39.870 --> 10:42.789
Would you make a miss?

10:42.790 --> 10:44.540
Well, thanks for the confidence.

10:44.880 --> 10:49.809
Hey, did you not say anything
to your wife about your coming here?

10:49.810 --> 10:52.050
I'm keeping it a secret,
just in case.

10:55.230 --> 10:58.180
Come have dinner here sometime.

10:58.640 --> 10:59.810
Thanks.

11:00.170 --> 11:02.499
Good luck, Cousin.

11:02.500 --> 11:03.280
Yeah.

11:13.020 --> 11:16.820
Why didn't you pick up the phone?

11:17.180 --> 11:19.119
Phone? What are you talking about?

11:19.120 --> 11:20.699
Don't play dumb!

11:20.700 --> 11:24.719
You said you were busy, but you were
actually flirting with Shisei, right?!

11:24.720 --> 11:26.959
You were in the middle of
something lewd, right?!

11:26.960 --> 11:30.539
Huh? How did you know
I was at Shisei's place?

11:30.540 --> 11:31.809
Because I'm a psychic!

11:31.810 --> 11:33.319
A psychic, huh?

11:33.320 --> 11:36.769
If you really love her so much,
then you two can get married!

11:36.770 --> 11:40.140
Then, no matter who inherits the house,
you can still get the company!

11:40.590 --> 11:42.709
You seem to be misunderstanding something.

11:42.710 --> 11:44.889
Shisei and I aren't like that.

11:44.890 --> 11:48.889
If you don't want to go back here,
then so be it! I'll live here alone!

11:48.890 --> 11:52.479
Food expenses will be halved,
so I can save for my retirement funds!

11:52.480 --> 11:52.979
Hey!

11:52.980 --> 11:54.489
What?!

11:54.490 --> 11:56.800
I have something for you...

11:58.340 --> 11:59.650
A present...

12:00.120 --> 12:01.220
Huh?

12:06.250 --> 12:09.549
It's the one I said I wanted...

12:09.550 --> 12:13.880
I was working as a translator
at my aunt's to afford that.

12:14.260 --> 12:16.629
Sorry I kept coming back late.

12:16.630 --> 12:20.479
Huh?! Wh-Why?!
What's going on here?!

12:20.480 --> 12:22.269
It's a sign of peace.

12:22.270 --> 12:25.489
Peace? So you want to be closer to me?

12:25.490 --> 12:26.490
If possible.

12:29.540 --> 12:31.020
Did I creep her out?

12:32.770 --> 12:34.530
Th-Thanks!

12:44.870 --> 12:45.789
What's up?

12:45.790 --> 12:49.000
What do you think?
Does it look good?

12:49.360 --> 12:51.380
Yeah, sure does.

12:53.120 --> 12:55.409
Are you going home late again today?

12:55.410 --> 12:57.759
No, I'm done with that work.

12:57.760 --> 13:01.010
I'll get you some delicious dinner, then!

13:09.760 --> 13:11.430
So pretty...

13:12.270 --> 13:14.399
About tonight's dinner...

13:14.400 --> 13:18.160
Don't peek! You freak!
That's trespassing!

13:18.650 --> 13:22.909
I did knock, though...
Were you too focused on something?

13:22.910 --> 13:24.990
I wasn't!

13:26.400 --> 13:29.499
These days, my wife's
been in a good mood...

13:29.500 --> 13:31.250
Oh, right!

13:32.750 --> 13:36.750
We still have a lot of meat,
so eat up!

13:37.350 --> 13:39.260
Y-Yeah...

13:41.110 --> 13:43.390
So good! This is good!

13:43.790 --> 13:46.139
Saito's eating meat!

13:46.140 --> 13:47.829
Yay!

13:47.830 --> 13:50.300
What is she, a three-year old
watching animal feeding?

13:59.030 --> 14:01.049
Hey, that ring...

14:01.050 --> 14:03.389
Morning, Akane, Saito!

14:03.390 --> 14:04.440
Morning...

14:04.750 --> 14:05.949
Saito?

14:05.950 --> 14:08.179
Hey! Don't touch me out of the blue!

14:08.180 --> 14:08.929
Come with me!

14:08.930 --> 14:11.210
Let go, you freak!
This is sexual harassment!

14:11.630 --> 14:15.210
Why are you bringing me here?
What's the deal?

14:15.590 --> 14:16.710
The ring...

14:17.110 --> 14:18.250
Ring?

14:21.520 --> 14:25.720
I'm glad that you're cherishing it,
but it'll be trouble if everyone finds out.

14:26.060 --> 14:30.669
I'm not! It's just too unimportant,
I forgot about it!

14:30.670 --> 14:33.429
Anyway, you'd better put it in your bag.

14:33.430 --> 14:35.999
You don't have to say that.

14:36.000 --> 14:38.859
I'll put it in my pouch
and then inside my bag.

14:38.860 --> 14:40.569
So you're cherishing it.

14:40.570 --> 14:42.350
I'm not!

14:45.490 --> 14:47.619
That is a pretty ring.

14:47.620 --> 14:49.699
Shisei?!

14:49.700 --> 14:51.619
Can I have that?

14:51.620 --> 14:53.769
Huh? No, you can't.

14:53.770 --> 14:56.099
Since you got it from Cousin?

14:56.100 --> 14:59.499
That's not it.
I like this ring.

14:59.500 --> 15:03.969
Then, I'll go buy the same one for you.
You can wear that instead.

15:03.970 --> 15:06.760
You can wear that one instead.

15:07.110 --> 15:09.890
Anyway, you can't have this one.

15:11.890 --> 15:14.890
NEKOOKA
OPEN UNTIL 11 PM

15:16.750 --> 15:18.900
Huh? You're kidding me...

15:19.500 --> 15:21.650
I did put it in here...

15:40.000 --> 15:44.380
I can't say that I lost the ring to him...

15:52.670 --> 15:54.390
What do I do?

15:54.950 --> 15:58.019
Then, I'll go buy the same one for you.

15:58.020 --> 15:59.769
That's it.

15:59.770 --> 16:01.520
THE PLACE WHERE YOUR CHARM WILL SHINE
NEWBIES ARE WELCOME!

16:02.130 --> 16:04.780
I can't just buy another one.

16:05.370 --> 16:09.780
It's the only ring in the world
given to me by Saito.

16:10.380 --> 16:14.040
You see,
a ring is someone's feelings of love.

16:14.530 --> 16:16.559
I'll definitely find it.

16:16.560 --> 16:18.870
Before Saito finds out!

16:20.070 --> 16:21.589
What's up, Akane?

16:21.590 --> 16:24.800
It's nothing! What about
Alien Hemecopteaulus?

16:25.100 --> 16:27.870
We weren't talking about that!

16:33.810 --> 16:37.810
NEKOOKA
OPEN UNTIL 11 PM

16:41.170 --> 16:43.569
Shisei?! What are you doing?

16:43.570 --> 16:45.429
Practicing my sighs.

16:45.430 --> 16:46.859
That so...

16:46.860 --> 16:50.819
Kidding. It seems you were troubled
by something, so I followed you.

16:50.820 --> 16:52.449
I'm not really...

16:52.450 --> 16:53.580
Did you lose it?

16:55.040 --> 16:56.640
No worries.

16:57.120 --> 17:01.499
I won't tell him.
I'll help you find it.

17:01.500 --> 17:02.330
Huh?

17:02.860 --> 17:07.510
You're a good person
who feeds me good meals.

17:07.950 --> 17:09.720
I don't want you to be sad.

17:10.240 --> 17:11.809
Shisei...

17:11.810 --> 17:17.180
Also, if you can't find the ring,
the house will be a warzone again.

17:17.710 --> 17:20.730
I want him to live in peace.

17:21.220 --> 17:25.230
So you really love him, huh?

17:25.540 --> 17:26.530
I do.

17:26.960 --> 17:30.490
I really love him.

17:45.740 --> 17:48.549
I'm sorry. Just forget about it.

17:48.550 --> 17:50.939
Giving up on the ring already?

17:50.940 --> 17:55.779
I'm not, but I can't trouble you anymore.

17:55.780 --> 17:57.789
I'll go look for it myself.

17:57.790 --> 18:01.139
It's your bad habit to think by yourself.

18:01.140 --> 18:03.460
It's on me, after all.

18:03.930 --> 18:07.269
I must find it myself.

18:07.270 --> 18:10.019
Why not ask for Cousin's help?

18:10.020 --> 18:13.689
He's so dependable,
he'll be able to solve anything.

18:13.690 --> 18:15.420
Anything but that!

18:17.620 --> 18:20.690
Anything... but that...

18:28.100 --> 18:29.759
What are you doing this late?

18:29.760 --> 18:31.630
Who do you think I was.

18:32.070 --> 18:34.449
Akane's still not back yet.

18:34.450 --> 18:37.349
Do you know where Akane went?

18:37.350 --> 18:38.760
No.

18:40.550 --> 18:45.839
This is the legendary treasure,
Akane's special seafood curry's scent!

18:45.840 --> 18:50.529
Akane smelled like curry,
so I was curious...

18:50.530 --> 18:53.969
So you really do know
where she is! Tell me!

18:53.970 --> 18:55.429
I can't.

18:55.430 --> 18:56.780
Did she bribe you?

18:57.170 --> 18:59.759
Even I have some pride as well.

18:59.760 --> 19:03.189
If you want to know,
you can just stalk her yourself.

19:03.190 --> 19:05.429
She'll be mad if she finds me.

19:05.430 --> 19:07.839
Don't worry, she won't.

19:07.840 --> 19:10.299
She's so desperate,
she won't have time for that.

19:10.300 --> 19:11.800
For what?

19:12.450 --> 19:14.549
Not telling.

19:14.550 --> 19:18.010
HEIANDAI ACADEMY

19:20.370 --> 19:22.570
She's doing this every day?

19:28.550 --> 19:29.950
Now that I look closely...

19:33.110 --> 19:35.029
Why can't I find it?

19:35.030 --> 19:37.799
The ring I got from Saito...

19:37.800 --> 19:39.730
I knew it was the ring.

19:40.490 --> 19:41.540
Saito?!

19:42.060 --> 19:44.929
Thanks for trying to look for it
with all your might.

19:44.930 --> 19:47.250
Just forget about it.
Let's go home.

19:47.600 --> 19:50.219
I can't! I definitely must find it!

19:50.220 --> 19:53.669
Don't sweat it.
We can buy another one.

19:53.670 --> 19:58.159
That's not the problem here...
It's not something you can buy back.

19:58.160 --> 19:59.139
Why?

19:59.140 --> 20:02.600
That ring... It's genuine.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.849
Huh?

20:03.850 --> 20:07.649
We were forced to marry each other,

20:07.650 --> 20:12.709
but that ring alone was
your genuine feelings for me!

20:12.710 --> 20:17.929
You worked hard to buy that
so we can get closer!

20:17.930 --> 20:22.030
So... I must get it back!

20:28.070 --> 20:31.579
You really are a stubborn one, huh?

20:31.580 --> 20:34.029
But...

20:34.030 --> 20:36.190
In that case, I'll go look for it too.

20:36.710 --> 20:38.380
When did you lose the ring?

20:38.940 --> 20:41.809
When I wore the ring to school...

20:41.810 --> 20:45.449
I put it in my pouch and then
into my backpack,

20:45.450 --> 20:48.069
but I lost the whole pouch
when I got home...

20:48.070 --> 20:49.139
I see.

20:49.140 --> 20:52.589
I already looked around the places
where I might lose it...

20:52.590 --> 20:56.719
No, not yet.
Don't you underestimate my memory.

20:56.720 --> 21:01.199
On that day, we went shopping
together after school.

21:01.200 --> 21:05.790
The path we took, the shops we entered,
the places we stopped by...

21:06.340 --> 21:07.840
It's all...

21:08.620 --> 21:10.790
...inside my head.

21:11.780 --> 21:15.789
You were wondering
if we should visit this cafe,

21:15.790 --> 21:18.129
and checked your wallet
before the entrance.

21:18.130 --> 21:21.129
Is that so?

21:21.130 --> 21:26.129
From what I saw, the moments you
opened your bag on the way home...

21:26.130 --> 21:29.949
...were at that time, when you brought
out a handkerchief to wipe your mouth,

21:29.950 --> 21:32.319
when you were trying
to take pictures of cats,

21:32.320 --> 21:35.209
and when you were shopping
at the supermarket. Five times.

21:35.210 --> 21:36.649
You counted that?

21:36.650 --> 21:38.379
I just did now.

21:38.380 --> 21:41.769
And when you opened
your bag before this cafe,

21:41.770 --> 21:44.410
you were standing around here.

21:49.290 --> 21:50.660
Hey, Saito!

21:54.250 --> 21:58.090
You really found it that easy...

21:59.600 --> 22:01.729
I'm genius, after all.

22:01.730 --> 22:04.709
Now you know why you
can't beat me in exams.

22:04.710 --> 22:06.049
Thank you!

22:06.050 --> 22:07.249
Hey!

22:07.250 --> 22:09.840
Thank you, thank you!

22:10.910 --> 22:12.150
Thank you...

22:19.430 --> 22:20.990
Don't lose it again, okay?

22:22.750 --> 22:25.030
You got it!

22:29.730 --> 22:34.719
Um... About the meaning of the finger
on which the ring is worn...

22:34.720 --> 22:35.750
Meaning?

22:36.270 --> 22:38.829
Engagement and marriage rings...

22:38.830 --> 22:42.639
...are basically worn on
your left ring finger.

22:42.640 --> 22:47.289
It's meant to deepen
your love and bonds...

22:47.290 --> 22:51.839
I was wearing it on my right hand
before losing it, right?

22:51.840 --> 22:55.489
And you put it on my left hand instead...

22:55.490 --> 22:57.769
I-Is that what I think it is?

22:57.770 --> 23:00.949
N-No... Okay!

23:00.950 --> 23:04.029
Let's put it on another finger!
Problem solved, then!

23:04.030 --> 23:05.679
Don't touch me, you freak!

23:05.680 --> 23:08.280
I'm just trying to put it
on a different finger!

23:09.630 --> 23:10.960
It's okay.

23:11.440 --> 23:14.410
I can wear it like this for today.

23:18.150 --> 23:20.300
I'm going now then...

23:20.830 --> 23:22.360
Sis.

23:23.710 --> 23:27.010
A student marriage? Unbelievable.

23:29.830 --> 23:34.160
I'll steal everything from you.

23:35.020 --> 23:41.110
#8 UPPERCLASSMAN
